Package: pulzr-uplinks
Provides: parkeze-uplinks
Replaces: parkeze-uplinks
Conflicts: parkeze-uplinks
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
Architecture: all
Description: Uplink order and failover.
 Sets each uplink's route metric from an order the site chooses, and pings
 out of each tracked uplink so one that keeps its link but carries nothing
 is moved behind the others. Failover only: one uplink carries traffic at a
 time. For boards with the failover feature; see boards/common/board.conf.
